WEBVTT

00:10:00.263 --> 00:10:04.097
I'm happy to report
that after months of struggle,

00:10:04.097 --> 00:10:06.030
I am now a runner.

00:10:06.063 --> 00:10:10.963
I became one simply
by allowing myself to be bad at it.

00:10:10.997 --> 00:10:13.363
You definitely could not
call me an athlete;

00:10:13.363 --> 00:10:16.430
there are no half-marathons in my future.

00:10:16.430 --> 00:10:18.263
But I am consistent.

00:10:18.863 --> 00:10:20.363
To paraphrase the Dalai Lama,

00:10:20.397 --> 00:10:22.763
the goal is not to be
better than other people

00:10:22.797 --> 00:10:26.763
but rather to be better
than our previous selves.

00:10:27.230 --> 00:10:29.197
And that, I definitely am.